# Caldera House — Flywire Checkout V2 demo
#
# This demo holds NO Flywire credentials. Every user enters their own Flywire
# DEMO credentials (client ID, recipient code, API key) in the hotel back office
# at /dashboard; they are stored in that user's browser.
#
# All Flywire calls go to the demo API (https://api-platform.demo.flywire.com).
# That is hard-coded: there is no setting to point this demo at production.

# Optional: receive session events (webhooks) at this URL.
# CPX_EVENT_URL=https://your-app.example.com/flywire/events

# Optional: partner recipient codes to prefill in "Split with partners".
# Empty by default. Use codes that are valid split partners of your own demo recipient.
# CPX_SPLIT_RECIPIENTS=ABC,DEF12

# Optional: enable capabilities that are not deployed to every environment yet.
# Supported: moto, timeout
# CPX_PREVIEW_FEATURES=moto,timeout

# Optional; default 3000. Most hosting platforms set PORT automatically.
# PORT=3000
